    "version": "1.1.0-pure-ro",
    "updated": "2026-05-18",
    "description": "Romanian e-commerce synonym dictionary, PURE Romanian only. v1.1 cleanup: removed all English terms (wallpaper, scale, frying pan, white, black, marble, shelter, gazebo, etc.) and archaic/uncommon Romanian (lipibil, marmoreal, balanta-for-modern-scales, etc.). Restricted to single-token-to-single-token mappings only — multi-token synonyms produced grammatically awkward candidates like 'placi folie decorativa autoadeziv'. Loanwords kept ONLY when Romanian e-commerce users actually search for them (smart, set, kit, LED, WiFi, Bluetooth).",
    "rules": [
      "RO only — no English equivalents",
      "1:1 token mapping only (avoid 1→2 token expansions)",
      "Skip archaic/literary terms — keep commercial spoken Romanian",
      "Skip technical jargon unless commonly searched"
    ]
  },

